#. module: no_debug_quick_switcher
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:no_debug_quick_switcher.field_res_users__x_debug_default_mode
msgid "Default Debug Mode"
msgstr "默认调试模式"

#. module: no_debug_quick_switcher
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:no_debug_quick_switcher.field_res_users__x_debug_default_mode
msgid ""
"Starting debug mode whenever you log in. Off by default. The switcher "
"in the navbar will land on this mode automatically — no more typing ?d"
"ebug=assets in the URL bar 30 times a day."
msgstr ""
"每次登录时的初始调试模式。默认为关闭。导航栏中的切换器会自动落在此模式 — 不再需要每天 30 次在 URL 栏中输入 ?debug=ass"
"ets。"

#. module: no_debug_quick_switcher
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:no_debug_quick_switcher.field_res_config_settings__x_debug_switcher_disabled
msgid "Disable Debug Switcher in Production"
msgstr "在生产环境中禁用调试切换器"

#. module: no_debug_quick_switcher
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:no_debug_quick_switcher.field_res_config_settings__x_debug_switcher_disabled
msgid ""
"When enabled, the navbar switcher hides and the per-user default is ig"
"nored. Recommended ON for production databases — it keeps users from a"
"ccidentally landing in Tests mode (which slows page loads dramatically"
" by loading QUnit assets)."
msgstr ""
"启用后,导航栏切换器会隐藏,并且会忽略每用户默认值。生产数据库建议开启 — 防止用户意外进入 Tests 模式(它会通过加载 QUnit 资"
"源大大减慢页面加载速度)。"

